 bound Japanese source in this unit.","remedy":"","highlights":[]},{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800511","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031c:00009","script":"CCC0031c.dsf","ordinal":9,"jp":"「調子悪いのか？」","en":"Taichi: \"Feeling off?\"","comments":[],"refs":["ccfc:sn:0207:000002ad:text"],"binding":"resolved","verdict":"acceptable","severity":"style","confidence":"high","categories":["presentation"],"assessment":"The English is supportable by the bound Japanese source in this unit.","remedy":"","highlights":[]},{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800512","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031c:00010","script":"CCC0031c.dsf","ordinal":10,"jp":"「カレーパンを食い過ぎた」","en":"Sakuraba: \"Ate too much curry bread.\"","comments":["Ridiculous! See CCC0024 again: he came to school hungry, and this is just Tuesday. See CCC3012b: he won't get tired until Thursday, possibly evening. Like with the oddities in CCC0027, this is Taichi slowly fraying into excessive chuuni, just like in Another Story. -GHS"],"refs":["ccfc:sn:0207:000002fc:text"],"binding":"resolved","verdict":"acceptable","severity":"style","confidence":"high","categories":["presentation"],"assessment":"The English is supportable by the bound Japanese source in this unit.","remedy":"","highlights":[]},{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800513","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031c:00011","script":"CCC0031c.dsf","ordinal":11,"jp":"起きてるのか。","en":"Is he awake?","comments":[],"refs":["ccfc:sn:0207:0000032e:text"],"binding":"resolved","verdict":"acceptable","severity":"style","confidence":"high","categories":["presentation"],"assessment":"The English is supportable by the bound Japanese source in this unit.","remedy":"","highlights":[]},{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800514","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031c:00012","script":"CCC0031c.dsf","ordinal":12,"jp":"しかし目は閉じている。","en":"But his eyes are closed.","comments":[],"refs":["ccfc:sn:0207:00000354:text"],"binding":"resolved","verdict":"acceptable","severity":"style","confidence":"high","categories":["presentation"],"assessment":"The English is supportable by the bound Japanese source in this unit.","remedy":"","highlights":[]},{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800515","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031c:00013","script":"CCC0031c.dsf","ordinal":13,"jp":"「四限分、カレーパンを食ったぞ」","en":"Sakuraba: \"Been eating curry bread for four periods.\"","comments":[],"refs":["ccfc:sn:0207:000003a7:text"],"binding":"resolved","verdict":"acceptable","severity":"style","confidence":"high","categories":["presentation"],"assessment":"The English is supportable by the bound Japanese source in this unit.","remedy":"","highlights":[]},{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800516","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031c:00014","script":"CCC0031c.dsf","ordinal":14,"jp":"「アホか」","en":"Taichi: \"You dumbass.\"","comments":[],"refs":["ccfc:sn:0207:000003e7:text"],"binding":"resolved","verdict":"acceptable","severity":"style","confidence":"high","categories":["presentation"],"assessment":"The English is supportable by the bound Japanese source in this unit.","remedy":"","highlights":[]},{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800517","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031c:00015","script":"CCC0031c.dsf","ordinal":15,"jp":"「だいぶ単位は稼いだはずだ」","en":"Sakuraba: \"I expect to earn a considerable amount of school credit.\"","comments":[],"refs":["ccfc:sn:0207:0000042e:text"],"binding":"resolved","verdict":"acceptable","severity":"style","confidence":"high","categories":["presentation"],"assessment":"The English is supportable by the bound Japanese source in this unit.","remedy":"","highlights":[]},{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800518","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031c:00016","script":"CCC0031c.dsf","ordinal":16,"jp":"「いや、うち単位制じゃないし」","en":"Taichi: \"Uhm, we're not on a credit system.\"","comments":[],"refs":["ccfc:sn:0207:0000046a:text"],"binding":"resolved","verdict":"acceptable","severity":"style","confidence":"high","categories":["presentation"],"assessment":"The English is supportable by the bound Japanese source in this unit.","remedy":"","highlights":[]},{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800519","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031c:00017","script":"CCC0031c.dsf","ordinal":17,"jp":"「小さいことだ。俺は気に